      "kind": "ability",
      "name": "Sprinkle Pixie Dust",
      "actions": 1,
      "category": "offensive",
      "traits": [
        "manipulate",
        "primal"
      ],
      "text": "The pixie sprinkles pixie dust onto one of their arrows. If the pixie hits a creature with that arrow before the pixie's next turn, the arrow inflicts one of the following special effects instead of dealing damage. Each effect depends on the target's DC 24 Will save. On a critical hit, the target gets a result one degree worse than it rolled.\n\n- Confusion (emotion, mental) (DC 24 Will save) The target suffers the effects of a 4th-rank confusion spell.\n\n- Shadow Shroud (darkness, incapacitation) (DC 24 Will save) On a failed Will save, the target is enveloped in shadows. It perceives its surroundings as though bright light conditions were only dim light and dim light as though it was darkness.\n\n- Supernatural Chill (cold, shadow) (DC 24 basic Will save) The target takes 5d6 cold damage (basic Fortitude save)."
    },
    {
      "kind": "ability",
      "name": "Warden's Protection",
      "category": "offensive",
      "text": "The pixie deals an additional 1d6 damage to any creature trespassing in the Gloaming Arbor.",
